{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 37,
  "title": "Passage 37",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s37-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p01.mp3",
      "en": "The Double Ninth Festival is a special day for elderly people in China.",
      "cn": "重阳节是中国为老年人设定的特殊节日。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s37-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p02.mp3",
      "en": "The festival is on the ninth day of the ninth month of the lunar calendar.",
      "cn": "重阳节在阴历第九个月份的第九天。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s37-p03-01",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p03-01.mp3",
      "en": "As the Chinese word for nine has the same sound as the word for long,",
      "cn": "由于汉字中的“九”与“久”同音，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s37-p03-02",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p03-02.mp3",
      "en": "people take the Double Ninth Festival to show their wishes of long life for elderly people.",
      "cn": "所以人们借重阳节表达对老人长寿的祝福。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s37-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p04.mp3",
      "en": "There are many traditions for this festival.",
      "cn": "重阳节有许多传统。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s37-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p05.mp3",
      "en": "On that day, families get together and climb mountains for luck and in the hope that elderly people will live much longer.",
      "cn": "在这一天，家人聚在一起爬山，既是为了祈求好运，也是希望老人能更长寿。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s37-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p06.mp3",
      "en": "They also drink chrysanthemum wine and wear a plant called zhuyu to celebrate it.",
      "cn": "他们还喝菊花酒，佩戴一种叫做“茱萸”的植物来庆祝。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s37-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p07.mp3",
      "en": "Both chrysanthemum and zhuyu are regarded as clean plants that can clean houses and cure diseases.",
      "cn": "菊花和茱萸都被视为洁净的植物，可以清洁房屋、治愈疾病。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s37-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p08.mp3",
      "en": "Respecting elderly people is shown not only on this special day but also in daily life.",
      "cn": "尊敬老人不仅体现在这个特殊的日子，也体现在日常生活中。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s37-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p09.mp3",
      "en": "For example, when an older person enters a room, everyone stands up as a mark of honour.",
      "cn": "例如，当一位老人进入房间时，所有人都会起身以示尊敬。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s37-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p10.mp3",
      "en": "When there are several guests at the table, the host shall introduce them from the oldest to the youngest.",
      "cn": "当桌上有好几位客人时，主人会以先长后幼的顺序来介绍他们。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s37-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p11.mp3",
      "en": "When a younger person is presenting something to an older person, two hands are used.",
      "cn": "年轻人向老年人递东西时，会双手奉上。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s37-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p12.mp3",
      "en": "On a crowded subway or bus, younger people always offer their seats to elderly people.",
      "cn": "在拥挤的地铁或公交车上，年轻人总是会给老人让座。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s37-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p13.mp3",
      "en": "It is a traditional virtue in China to respect elderly people.",
      "cn": "尊敬老人是中国的传统美德。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s37-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p14.mp3",
      "en": "That's because the Chinese know that elderly people have knowledge and experience that young people can learn from.",
      "cn": "这是因为中国人深知，老人拥有值得年轻人学习的知识和经验。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s37-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p15.mp3",
      "en": "So Chinese people are proud of being old.",
      "cn": "所以，中国人以老为荣。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s37-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s37-p16.mp3",
      "en": "Besides, to respect elderly people is to respect yourself tomorrow.",
      "cn": "而且，尊敬老人也是在尊敬明天的自己。"
    }
  ],
